## Conditional autonomous merge evidence

<!-- Required only when an agent proposes to merge without a human. Every row must be evidenced; uncertainty means do not merge. -->
- [ ] No deploy or production effect.
- [ ] Low-risk and additive/isolated; no auth, security, billing, schema/data, provider, AI-semantics, or visible-UI impact.
- [ ] Current fetched base, no active conflicting work, and actual diff independently reviewed.
- [ ] Every required check passed and no unresolved product/design/material-architecture decision remains.

## Human gates (agents leave unchecked)

- [ ] Human approves any merge that deploys or mutates production.
- [ ] Human approves deploy/publish, production config/write, or data migration.
- [ ] Human approves destructive/irreversible, billed/purchase, secret, or external-contact action.
- [ ] Human approves unresolved product scope, visible design/copy, or material architecture decision.
